          ],
          "text": "The general entry point to Higgsfield. Unless you name a model, the agent picks a default for the task, such as GPT Image 2.5 for images or Seedance 2.5 for video, plus models for cartoon characters, sound and music, and turning one to four photos into a 3D model. Images, videos or audio you give it go in as references. For ads, it makes branded videos and images from a product (imported from a URL or photos), a presenter avatar and a style such as creator-style clip, unboxing or TV spot. It can also score a video you already made, rating its opening hook, attention and retention instead of generating anything. Replies are short: the result link and a one-line summary. To keep a real person's face consistent across generations, it uses a face model trained with higgsfield-soul-id.",
