          "text": "First the agent writes an algorithmic philosophy: a named movement, such as \"Organic Turbulence\", described in four to six paragraphs in terms of noise, particles, forces and emergent behavior. It works a subtle nod to your request into the parameters rather than illustrating it literally. The code is built on a bundled viewer template with a fixed layout: a sidebar with the seed (shown, with previous, next, random and jump-to buttons), the parameters, optional color pickers, and buttons to regenerate, reset or download a PNG. Only the algorithm and its controls change from piece to piece. All randomness comes from the seed, so a seed reproduces its image exactly. The result loads p5.js from a CDN and runs in a claude.ai artifact or any browser with no setup. The philosophy comes as a Markdown file.",
