      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Generates images, video, music and audio, and posts to social platforms, from the terminal.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "an agent should make marketing content, such as ads, short social videos or posts, and publish it from the terminal"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "drives the wonda CLI: generates images, video, music and speech, edits them, and posts to Instagram and TikTok"
            },
            {
              "label": "Also",
              "text": "searches, reads, posts, comments and messages on LinkedIn, X and Reddit, writing through a browser built so platforms can't flag it as automation"
            },
            {
              "label": "Needs",
              "text": "the wonda CLI and a paid Wonda plan for every command: $19.99 a month, or $49.99 with cloud twins"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Wonda is a paid content service, and this skill, at over 30,000 words, is the manual for its command line. It casts the agent as a marketing director: first gather context (your saved brand, what has performed, what competitors post), then look for one of Wonda's hosted step-by-step guides, such as talking-head ads, TikTok carousels or LinkedIn posts in your voice, and only then chain commands by hand. It sets defaults: GPT Image 2 for images, Seedance 2 for video, Suno for music, ElevenLabs for speech, portrait 9:16 for social, and your prompt used as written, not embellished. Editing covers captions, text overlays, audio mixing and cutting long videos into vertical shorts, with plain ffmpeg preferred for simple local edits. Posts, comments and messages on LinkedIn, X and Reddit go through a browser that keeps each account's login and is disguised so platforms can't flag it as automation, within daily action caps. Cloud twins are those accounts run on Wonda's servers behind mobile-network proxies, on schedules. It also documents creating new LinkedIn and Reddit accounts with throwaway mailboxes, a feature Wonda turns on per account.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/degausai/wonda/tree/7afa71f4cb5aeaf8d083e155221167418a5aa43f/skills/wonda-cli"
