      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Runs a minimal reproduction and records the evidence.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "setup is done and you want a short documented run, such as a smoke test, inference or evaluation, with its evidence on record"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "runs that one command, or takes output already captured, and writes standard report files about it"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "a repro_outputs folder: summary, commands, log and status, plus notes on what changed and how comparable the result is"
            },
            {
              "label": "Not for",
              "text": "training runs, choosing what to reproduce, or setting up the environment"
            },
            {
              "label": "Usually called by",
              "text": "RigorPilot's main skill, which reproduces a research repo from its README, which picks the command to run"
            }
          ],
          "text": "The evidence step in RigorPilot, a set of skills that reproduces deep-learning research code by following its README. A run that passes shows the chosen command works, not that the paper's numbers were reproduced, and the reports keep that distinction. Each one states whether the run was full, partial, only a quick check, or blocked, names the documented command, separates facts from inferences and puts the main blocker up front. Two files guard what the result means: a scientific changelog lists anything that changed it, such as a different preprocessing step or checkpoint, and a comparability report says how far it can be compared with the README, the paper or a baseline. If repo files were edited to make the run work, PATCHES.md lists them, and no change to evaluation, preprocessing, checkpoints or metrics may be hidden.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/lllllllama/rigorpilot-skills/tree/fb3ccdf5aa64b1fa5b1d0463e666a8bc8bc26e01/skills/minimal-run-and-audit"
